  "title": "Edit: re-pattern flange to 8 bolts",
  "units": "mm",
  "nl_spec": "Below is existing build123d code for a pipe flange. Modify it so the bolt pattern has EIGHT equally spaced \u00d811 mm holes on the same 95 mm pitch-circle diameter, keeping every other dimension unchanged (OD 120, bore \u00d840, thickness 14).\n\n```python\nfrom build123d import BuildPart, Cylinder, Locations, Mode, PolarLocations\n\nwith BuildPart() as flange:\n    Cylinder(radius=60, height=14)\n    Cylinder(radius=20, height=14, mode=Mode.SUBTRACT)\n    with PolarLocations(radius=47.5, count=6):\n        Cylinder(radius=5.5, height=14, mode=Mode.SUBTRACT)\n\nresult = flange.part\n```",
